{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Everything show is alpha footage and can be changed at any moments.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battlers Of Ekrasys</strong><br>A deep, text-based autobattler RPG where strategy meets endless progression! Fight, Loot, Craft new spells and armors, and master the art of the Smithmagic using a runes system !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 How Does It Work?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose <strong>5 spells</strong> from your collection \u2013 they will cycle endlessly in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat monsters, <strong>earn loot</strong>, and instantly face new foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every <strong>X waves</strong>, a <strong>boss</strong> appears \u2013 test your build\u2019s strength!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn <strong>new spells</strong> from fallen monsters and expand your arsenal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Deep Crafting &amp; Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment</strong> by fusing spells to create a mix of those spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft</strong> powerful jewels with randomly generated prefixes &amp; suffixes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>Smithmagic</strong> to modify your gear \u2013 upgrade and optimize your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot</strong> materials to craft new items and improve your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 Progression That Never Stops</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn <strong>XP &amp; level up</strong> to unlock stronger spells, and stronger resources for your craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your stats, master resistances, and break through <strong>wave after wave</strong> of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different <strong>spell synergies and item builds</strong> to dominate the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Minimalist, Engaging Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pure text-based combat</strong> with a <strong>clean UI</strong> and deep strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idle mechanics allow you to <strong>progress even when AFK</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Ready to Begin Your Journey?<br>Add Battlers Of Ekrasys to your wishlist and prepare to dive into an <strong>infinite RPG adventure</strong> unlike any other!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612740?t=1743009597","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612740?t=1743009597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612740/b41d3786170257252369969561e965b2762caf01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743009597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612740/b41d3786170257252369969561e965b2762caf01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743009597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Everything show is alpha footage and can be changed at any moments.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battlers Of Ekrasys</strong><br>A deep, text-based autobattler RPG where strategy meets endless progression! Fight, Loot, Craft new spells and armors, and master the art of the Smithmagic using a runes system !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 How Does It Work?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose <strong>5 spells</strong> from your collection \u2013 they will cycle endlessly in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat monsters, <strong>earn loot</strong>, and instantly face new foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every <strong>X waves</strong>, a <strong>boss</strong> appears \u2013 test your build\u2019s strength!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn <strong>new spells</strong> from fallen monsters and expand your arsenal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Deep Crafting &amp; Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experiment</strong> by fusing spells to create a mix of those spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft</strong> powerful jewels with randomly generated prefixes &amp; suffixes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>Smithmagic</strong> to modify your gear \u2013 upgrade and optimize your stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot</strong> materials to craft new items and improve your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 Progression That Never Stops</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn <strong>XP &amp; level up</strong> to unlock stronger spells, and stronger resources for your craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your stats, master resistances, and break through <strong>wave after wave</strong> of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different <strong>spell synergies and item builds</strong> to dominate the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Minimalist, Engaging Gameplay</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pure text-based combat</strong> with a <strong>clean UI</strong> and deep strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idle mechanics allow you to <strong>progress even when AFK</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Ready to Begin Your Journey?<br>Add Battlers Of Ekrasys to your wishlist and prepare to dive into an <strong>infinite RPG adventure</strong> unlike any other!</p>","developers":["Itchys"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612740/eed0f6371346f052b89a0194b3ec2f0cb3cf7671/header.jpg?t=1743009597","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Battlers Of Ekrasys","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Uh ?<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Itchys"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612740/b6f7f18ac022a69b26086f0e5afd0abfcf6a2293/ss_b6f7f18ac022a69b26086f0e5afd0abfcf6a2293.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743009597","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612740/b6f7f18ac022a69b26086f0e5afd0abfcf6a2293/ss_b6f7f18ac022a69b26086f0e5afd0abfcf6a2293.600x338.jpg?t=1743